error[NK1131]: You can't give away `l[0]` here: it is an element of `l`, which keeps it.
   --> tests/keep_parameter_refuses_a_view.nika:15:5
    |
 15 |     println(f(l[0]))
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = note: `l[0]` reads an element `l` keeps, and what `l` keeps is lent, whether `l` is owned here or borrowed. Giving it away by value would take it out of `l`, and Nikaia never copies behind your back.
    = help: Write `l[0].clone()` for a copy.
